  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>y</mi></math></p><p>Given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>|</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>|</mo><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8805;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8805;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>|</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo>|</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>|</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><msup><mo>|</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p>Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><menclose notation=\"box\"><mo>|</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><msubsup><mo>|</mo><mrow><mo>Max</mo><mo>.</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></menclose></math>&nbsp;(where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math> is in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>rd</mi></msup></math> quadrant)&nbsp;</p><p>for point of intersection&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>B</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>|</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo>|</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>32</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>32</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>48</mn></math></p>"
